 "notes": [
  "Starting (5) as posted: Endor, Operational As Planned, Moff Jerjerrod, Desperate Counter and Death Star II (posted 'DSII'); no objective, so starting.card is the first-listed location. Total 60 as published; the Interrupts header says 8 and Effects 4, but 9 Interrupts and 5 Effects are listed (the Starting 5 and other headers add to 58).",
  "The strategy says to 'get the epic event down asap' (the title points to That Thing's Operational), but no Epic Event is in the list; not added.",
  "Posted 'SFS L-s8.2 Laser Cannons x2' names no real card; dested SFS L-s7.2 TIE Cannon, the only other SFS cannon in the pool (for the Scythe TIE/ln starfighters the strategy says take shots in the movement phase). 'Imperial Enforcement (or whatever it is called)' dested Oppressive Enforcement, the only 'Enforcement' card of the time (Imperial Enforcement is a later virtual card); it is the Special Edition Effect.",
  "'Forest', 'Jungle' and 'Swamp' (listed under Kashyyyk) dested the generic Special Edition sites. 'Coolant Shaft', 'Capacitors', 'Reactor Core' dested the Death Star II sites; 'Baron Fel' Baron Soontir Fel; 'Lt. Hebsly' Lieutenant Hebsly; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Mara's Saber' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Vader's Saber' Vader's Lightsaber; 'Alert Me Star Destroyer' Alert My Star Destroyer!; 'I Can't Shake Him' I Can't Shake Him!; Control is the Dark Dagobah Interrupt."
